    <ul>
        <li><strong>Elf names:</strong> Aelindra, Thalion, Caladwen, Elarion, Sylvara. Long, musical, vowel-rich names suitable for high-fantasy settings.</li>
        <li><strong>Dwarf names:</strong> Borin, Durbrek, Thogrim, Galdrek, Hrundin. Short, strong, consonant-heavy names that feel sturdy and ancient.</li>
